Zucchini, Kender.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Bineva şite? Novî xojê ne şite?
 
Is this below yours? Is the new one not yours?

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Ki derê dîkan? Rol gindî jor heye...
 
Where is the shop? Is there a road to the upper village...

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Çil û yek sal ne?
 
Isn't he forty-one years old?

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Berekeh emir çende?
 
Brother, how old are you?

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Roj baş hevalno, xûçkno, birano, em hûr hatin vîdyokî xweş
