We came to film Xozyana, to present this place.

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Tebîetê Xozyana, cografiya Xozyana em pêşwa kin.
 
To present the nature of Xozyana, the geography of Xozyana.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Bîr nekin te'lîq nexweş meriv mîşkin, her yekî te'lîqê meriv
