Don't forget, do not write bad comments, everyone writes a
comment like themselves.

13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Çavê gindî maş dikim, em te'lîqê wagîyê dibînin.
 
I kiss the eyes of the villagers, we see their comments.

14
