19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Sat xweş e, mezet.
 
Have a good time, excuse me.

20
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Erê hevalno me go Xozyana ne mezine, 125 mal ne.
 
Yes friends, we said Xozyana isn't big, it's 125 houses.

21
