the chance.

30
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Hûn zanin noko jî cew xweş bî ye em jî hatine.
 
You know the weather is nice now, so we came.

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Ko bi mera bin em derbaz bin.
 
So stay with us, let's pass through.

32
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:28,000
Erê vê derê me dest pê kir.
 
Yes, we started here.

33
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Hûn dîsa hisêtin.
 
You hear it again.

34
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Tabiî sikanê Xozyana hîn gund nehatî...
 
