village yet...

35
00:04:45,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Av kaniya xerabe ye.
 
This spring is ruined.

36
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:13,000
Erê hevalno vê derê hember me Mabata ye.
 
Yes friends, this place opposite us is Mabata.

37
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Takra Ereba tê.
 
Takra Ereba is there.

38
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:19,000
Mentiqe pir xuyn tê, heta Efrîn xuyn tê.
 
The area is very visible, even Afrin is visible.

39
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Wa gundê Kêlîbûn e, Berbenê, Gulyo, gundê Şêx, Avrazê...
 
That is Kêlîbûn village, Berbenê, Gulyo, Şêx village,
Avrazê...

40
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:28,000
Kerke Jûr Jêr... Ba'dîna gundê Qopê...
 
Upper and Lower Kerke... Ba'dina, Qopê village...

41
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Gidar xuyn tê gundê hebu me wara go, gundê Qidek... Dêrwîş
