It's so visible, the village existed, we told you, Qidek
village... Dêrwîş is visible to us.

42
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,000
Maşalla cîkî bilind e.
 
Mashallah, it's a high place.

43
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Hev jî gundê Olkana ye.
 
And this is Olkana village.

44
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Tabiî noko emê wara xweş kîbar bisewirînin.
 
Of course, now we will film this nice lovely place for you.

45
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:43,000
Hewalî mivî hewş no giyo nîzik bike, wana kîbar, giyo.
 
My friend, zoom in on these yards entirely, they are lovely,
