50
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:01,000
Wano jî şte mera malê giyo derkewê, gundî giyo derkewê,
hewşî mera dernakevê çiçkî ewe.
 
That is also something, the whole house appears to us, the
whole village appears, but the yard doesn't appear to us,
that's a small thing.

51
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Çetin e.
 
It is difficult.

52
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Maşalla çi gundekî xweş kîbar e.
 
Mashallah, what a nice lovely village.

53
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Li ewel merre ez têm vî gundî.
 
For the first time I am coming to this village.

54
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Heyatê xwe da cara nehatime.
 
In my life, I have never come.

55
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:16,000
Û miva nîzik e, ne zêde ne dûr e.
 
And it is close to me, not very far.

56
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Mabeyna min û Olkana... yanê...
 
Between me and Olkana... meaning...

57
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Daw heft kîlo hene tinen e.
 
About seven kilometers, there is or there isn't.

58
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Daw pênc kîlometre. Bes ewel merre ez têm viro.
 
About five kilometers. But for the first time I am coming
here.

59
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Ka em herin novgind kevin.
 
Let's go enter inside the village.

60
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Selamun eleykum.
 
Peace be upon you.

61
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Maşalla, maşalla, avol no em hatin bra Xozyana.
 
Mashallah, mashallah, friends we came to Xozyana.

62
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Mokîna Xidra heye, teb'en Xidra li nov gundo digere.
 
There is a vegetable car, naturally vegetables circulate
