Min go mamset ka em jamêrek bikrin, kenderê xwe pir teze ne.
 
I said let's stop, let's interact with a gentleman, his
'Kender' are very fresh.

64
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Bi çin e kender?
 
How much are the Kender?

65
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
Sî.
 
Thirty.

66
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
Hemûyê badînî dibên kender.
 
All of Badina calls it Kender.

67
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Kûsa, kender.
 
Zucchini, Kender.

68
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Ewa, kîlo bi sî?
 
Yes, a kilo for thirty?

69
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Xalo tu bi xwe ji vî gundî ne?
 
Uncle, are you from this village?

70
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Na, Xozûniyê jêr e.
 
No, Lower Xozuni.

71
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Ewa, Xozûniyê jêr heye û yê jor heye.
 
Yes, there is a Lower Xozuni and an Upper one.

72
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Erê erê.
 
Yes yes.

73
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Saet be canî te.
 
Health to your soul.

74
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Na na na saet be.
 
No no no health to you.

75
