Xalo Xozûniyê jêr û jor va çiqas hewşê derkevin?
 
Uncle, between Lower and Upper Xozuni, how many households
would there be?

76
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,000
Çiqas heye hewş?
 
How many yards/houses are there?

77
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,000
Hewş sed mal zêde heye.
 
Yards, there are more than a hundred houses.

78
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,000
Sed mal a?
 
A hundred houses?

79
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Zêde heye... sed pêncî şêst heye.
 
There are more... there are a hundred and fifty, sixty.

80
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:10,000
Sed garak sed bîst pênc derkevin.
 
A hundred, maybe a hundred and twenty-five would result.

81
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Tabiî nahiyê Mabata ye, ne?
 
Of course, it belongs to Mabata sub-district, right?

82
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:15,000
Hhm hhm.
 
Mhm mhm.

83
