95
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Ê kî ne ev no? Ew gund e?
 
And who are these people? Is that the village?

96
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:16,000
Me got xozan e, xozan... Tê xozanê?
 
I said it is a stubble field, stubble field... Do you
