97
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Erê xozan e.
 
Yes, it is a stubble field.

98
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Yane cîyê, ne evî xozan e şît e.
 
Meaning the place... no, this stubble field is a nursery
