99
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Ez nizanim, ne xeyîr, pşta gundî wa da hene?
 
I don't know, no goodness, is it behind the village there?

100
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:29,000
Naka em çûn, çaxmaqê merê gor, qebrê xwedê çaxmaq e.
 
Now we went, the lighter of the man's grave, God's grave is
