102
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,000
Xalo mekteb gundî wa da hene?
 
Uncle, is there a school in their village?

103
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Heye, heye, şaxol e.
 
There is, there is, it is active (working).

104
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
Şaxol e? Erê?
 
