108
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:51,000
Heştûsê, heştûçar heta heştûpênc ez li vira bîm.
 
In '48, '48 to '45 ['50], I was here.

109
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Paşê aşê hatin li vêderê çêkirin, me berda.
 
Then the mills were built here, and we quit.

110
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Xwedê te bihêle. Xalo qîçik miçkê te li derva hene?
 
May God keep you. Uncle, do you have small children outside
