115
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:13,000
Ev camîya kevin e li hecer e?
 
Is this the old mosque made of stone?

116
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Wele bîst sal zêde ye... Bîst sal. Ez û Rêzan zane, em yê li
pişta camîyê ne.
 
By God, it's been more than twenty years... Twenty years.
Rezan and I know, we are behind the mosque.

117
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Silavê me şîyar hene, û bi mara bêje, emê noka lextekî xoş
