Our greetings are sent, and tell us, we will now show you a
nice clip, film it, and you watch it.

118
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
Saet a te xweş xalo, Xwedê emrê te dirêj bike tade.
 
Bless you uncle, may God prolong your life for you.

119
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:28,000
Selamet bî.
 
Be safe.

120
