121
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:36,000
Navê vana çine?
 
What are their names?

122
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:43,000
(To the kids) Hûn e blê?
 
(To the kids) Are you going to say it?

123
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,000
Ev ne xeyarê, xeyarê zer min çine?
 
These aren't cucumbers, what are yellow cucumbers to me?

124
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,000
Te ne dîtiye? Heke tekim tê werî, manî te dît bibî.
 
Have you not seen them? If I put it in, you eat it, meaning
you have seen it before.

125
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:52,000
E lê, manî lewa... Ha.
 
Oh yes, meaning yes... Here.

126
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
M'az da jî bra ew dike... Kûso.
 
M'az also brother, he does that... Kuso (name or nickname).

127
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Enê loyî min enê.
 
Here is my son, here.

128
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Maşallah canê xweş ciwan e.
 
Mashallah, the soul is beautifully young.

129
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Bîbar e gundî bin la? Maşallah çi bîber ne.
 
Are these village peppers? Mashallah, what peppers they are.

130
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:13,000
Wele li cem me be'dînî nayên a ne, li dikanê cem me ew nayên
a.
 
By God, among us Badinis they don't come like this, in our
shops they don't come like this.

131
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Ev xelatê min darê, siqûlol, mofînê xo tişt dikê û tê li
gunda digerê. De?
 
This gift of mine [unclear], ... does his thing and comes
wandering in the villages. Okay?

132
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Ecîbe ecîbe titekî.
 
It's strange, it's a strange thing.

133
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:25,000
M'azê jî findarê terfo.
 
M'az is also [unclear context, possibly regarding a specific
tree or fruit].

134
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:28,000
Maşallah ba'can be çine?
 
Mashallah, what are the eggplants?

135
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Bîst ereqol.
 
Twenty [unclear unit/type].

136
