138
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,000
Erê wele, teze ye na xalo?
 
Yes by God, it is fresh, isn't it Uncle?

139
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,000
Erê wele.
 
Yes, by God.

140
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Maşallah, wirû rok germik e jî ha.
 
Mashallah, today is a bit of a hot day too, huh.

141
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,000
Haftok denone.
 
It is "Haftok" (peak summer heat).

142
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:49,000
Haftok e ne? Erê ev hal no.
 
It is "Haftok", isn't it? Yes, this is the situation.

